    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: Any reviews that claim I randomly ban people because i feel like it/calling me a jerk are false. I will only EVER ban you if there's reasonable suspicion, and even then, I still make sure I check to be safe. i want this game to be fair for everybody, and I will always be as nice as possible to everybody who even considered buying the game. Again- i will NEVER ban your account withour reasonable suspicion of you violating the Terms of Service.<br><br>With that out of the way,<br>The Croaker is a very fun, feature-packed game where you can collect apples. Where's the fun in that? Well, these apples you collect are used all throughout the game: You can buy skins, powerups, unlock many achievements, and compete on leaderboards against the top players!<br><br>  There are 50 campaign levels, where the protagonist, Jeremy, gets trapped in a simulation and must escape without the antagonist of Virtual Guy finding him. Not only that, there are going to be brand new Bonus Levels every few updates just to keep adding content to the game.<br><br>That's not enough? Well, try to create a level with the Level Editor for tons of people to play! Want a burst of action? Try speedrunning and competing with the people from those leaderboards! Maybe you don't think it's fun enough? Try Battle Mode, where you can compete in a free-for-all gun game against your friends and be victorious.. or die a tragic death. <br><br>There's so much packed into such a simple idea, and the best part is, thre's tons more coming! What's in this version might be a fraction of what you see in a future release! Keep scrolling to take a look at some of the features that are in the game as of the most recent update.<br><br><br>A look at the Main Menu<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/2b1926eabbcd63f53816aa5f1b4f00dd.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at the Play menu<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/2f36461b28742a98ac5b15d56835d9a4.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at the Apple Leaderboards\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/0c0493109b5b1736506b16bc965794d8.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>A look at the Speedrun Leaderboards<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/5520835b39763c5bfdf16bd1fdb25e36.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at the Shop<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/a643a837705f13f3770c8278e01aea42.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><br>A look at the Locker<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/f904cd48193641043b3796c8e0dccc87.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at Chapter 1, Level 1 (Minimap View)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/77cb38fbf8386a7d7206c1ba39f5cdae.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at Chapter 2, Level 7 (Minimap View)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/8cc5a5cc4679c3b23e228fe3495e356d.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at Chapter 3, Level 5 (Minimap View)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/767afc069f7fb33f677b50defd8e8b1c.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at Chapter 4, Level 12 (Minimap View)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/01bfdcd8884e848f23054f31cbc49c0c.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A look at the first Bonus Level (Minimap View)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/0c87ed263106109b05ef1cf62518b7d0.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>A look at the Level Editor<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/50dde0a2ef81657393deefd40c6eebf0.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>A look at an Online Level<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920070/extras/953e628ce215565dff900a3b87f23022.avif?t=1744686162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>&quot;made me dissolve into <strong>hydrogen atoms</strong>&quot; -funkedt0ast, Artist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>frog&quot;</strong>- Botscoutt, Playtester</p>",
